---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, NOT_AFFILIATED } from '../../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer – AyTool"
  description="AyTool provides independent estimates based on official schedules. It is not affiliated with any Philippine government agency and its results are not official determinations."
  path="/disclaimer/"
>
  <article class="content-prose mx-auto max-w-content px-4 pt-8">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-3xl">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="mt-4"><em>Last updated: August 19, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Independence</h2>
    <p>{NOT_AFFILIATED}</p>
    <p>
      We use the agencies' names (SSS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG, BIR, DOLE, DMW, PRC) only to describe
      what each calculator computes. All trademarks belong to their owners. Official transactions —
      paying contributions, checking records, filing applications, viewing exam results — happen
      only on the agencies' own websites, which we link on every page.
    </p>

    <h2>Estimates, not determinations</h2>
    <p>
      Every result on AyTool is an <strong>estimate</strong> computed from the official published
      schedules and the statutory minimums. Your actual payroll figures can differ for legitimate
      reasons: company policies more generous than the law, collective bargaining agreements,
      retroactive rate adjustments, loan deductions, special employment arrangements, or agency
      billing particulars. The results here do not replace your employer's payroll computation, an
      agency's official assessment, or professional advice.
    </p>

    <h2>No legal, tax or financial advice</h2>
    <p>
      Content on this site is general information about published rules. It is not legal, tax,
      accounting or financial advice. For decisions that depend on your specific situation,
      consult the relevant agency or a qualified professional.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      We verify every rate against official sources and show the verification date on each page
      (see <a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a> and <a href="/sources/">Sources</a>). Rules
      change; if an agency issues a new schedule before we update, the official issuance prevails.
      Found a discrepancy? Please tell us:
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      AyTool is provided "as is", free of charge. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we accept
      no liability for losses arising from reliance on the estimates or from decisions made based
      on this site's content.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
